title: $:/DefaultTiddlers
description: Story river shown on load. Dogear tiddlers (ebook reading) appear first; when any exist, the top favorite and journal placeholder are skipped, otherwise the default home stream from $:/lithic/config/DefaultHomeStream is shown. Journal tiddlers whose raw-date is in the future are excluded from home.

